---
layout: base.njk
title: "Special Tours | Heroes and Heritage Tours"
description: "Commemorative departures, including our Vimy 110 and 49th Battalion Pilgrimage tours, planned for 2027."
activeNav: special-tours
permalink: "/special-tours.html"
---

<header class="hero hero--compact">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="/photos/vimy/vimy-cover.jpg" alt="The Canadian National Vimy Memorial against a blue sky" width="1800" height="1200">
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Special tours</span>
      <h1>Commemorative departures on the horizon.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Beyond our regular Western Front and Normandy tours, we run occasional commemorative departures tied to significant anniversaries. Two are in the works for 2027.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in specialTours %}
      <article class="tour-card">
        <a href="/special-tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html" class="tour-card-media">
          <img src="{{ tour.heroImage }}" alt="{{ tour.heroAlt }}" width="800" height="600">
          <span class="tour-card-badge tour-card-badge--combo">Coming Soon</span>
        </a>
        <div class="tour-card-body">
          <h3><a href="/special-tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html">{{ tour.name }}</a></h3>
          <div class="tour-card-meta"><span>{{ tour.dateLabel }}</span></div>
          <p class="tour-card-desc">{{ tour.summary }}</p>
          <div class="tour-card-footer">
            <a href="/special-tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2>Looking for a regular departure instead?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Our Western Front day and multi-day tours run year-round from Arras.</p>
      <a href="/tours.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">See Western Front Tours</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
